<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>eseo Wiki | Parnas AI Operations Wiki</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/style.css"/></head><body><div class="app auth-locked" id="app"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark">W</div><div><h1>eseo Wiki</h1><p>HTML / Markdown Import Hub · Firebase</p></div></div><section class="auth-card"><div id="authLoggedOut"><h2>로그인이 필요합니다</h2><p>Firebase Authentication 계정으로 로그인하세요.</p><form id="loginForm" class="login-form"><label>이메일<input id="loginEmail" type="email" value="airwav7@gmail.com" required/></label><label>비밀번호<input id="loginPassword" type="password" required/></label><button class="btn primary full" type="submit">로그인</button></form></div><div id="authLoggedIn" class="hidden"><h2>로그인됨</h2><p id="userEmail" class="user-email"></p><button class="btn full" id="logoutBtn" type="button">로그아웃</button></div></section><div data-auth-only class="side-actions"><button class="btn primary full" id="newDocBtn" type="button">+ 새 문서</button><button class="btn full" id="markdownImportBtn" type="button">Markdown 붙여넣기</button><button class="btn full" id="htmlImportBtn" type="button">HTML 붙여넣기</button></div><label data-auth-only class="search-box"><span>⌕</span><input id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="문서 검색"/></label><nav data-auth-only class="category-list" id="categoryList"></nav><div class="sidebar-foot"><span class="dot"></span><span id="connectionText">Firebase Auth / Firebase DB 대기중</span></div></aside><main class="main" data-auth-only><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">PARNAS AI OPERATIONS WIKI</p><h2>HTML 매뉴얼을<br/>디자인 그대로 위키에 저장</h2><p>문서 엔진은 단순하게, HTML 매뉴얼은 위키용 파일로 분리해 안정적으로 관리합니다.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn ghost" id="seedBtn" type="button">샘플 추가</button><button class="btn ghost" id="backupBtn" type="button">JSON 백업</button></div></section><section class="stats"><div class="stat"><span>전체 문서</span><strong id="statTotal">0</strong></div><div class="stat"><span>HTML 매뉴얼</span><strong id="statHtml">0</strong></div><div class="stat"><span>운영매뉴얼</span><strong id="statManual">0</strong></div><div class="stat"><span>최근 업데이트</span><strong id="statUpdated">-</strong></div></section><section id="listView" class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3 id="listTitle">전체 문서</h3><p><span id="listCount">0</span>개</p></div><span class="badge">Firebase DB</span></div><div class="doc-grid" id="docList"></div><div class="pager" id="pager"></div></section><section id="detailView" class="panel hidden"></section><section id="formView" class="panel hidden"></section></main></div><button id="topBtn" class="top-btn" type="button">↑</button><div id="toast" class="toast"></div><script type="module" src="./js/app.js"></script></body></html>
